#=GF CC This entry contains a glucosamine-6-phosphate activated ribozyme that is
#=GF CC found in the mRNA for GlmS. GlmS is an enzyme that uses
#=GF CC fructose-6-phosphate and glutamine to generate glucosamine-6-phosphate.
#=GF CC The ribozyme catalyses self cleavage of the glmS mRNA that is thought to
#=GF CC regulate GlmS activity [1].
